{"kind": "reader_page", "number": 341, "text": "1120                毛泽东选集 抗日战争时期              强我军对敌人的进攻。全国人民必须注意制止内战危险，努             力促成民主联合政府的建立。中国民族解放战争的新阶段已             经到来了，全国人民应该加强团结，为夺取最后胜利而斗争。             ……", "printed_page": null, "reader_alignment_verified": true, "witness_id": "A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/4c7451f802ad6cc211c9bec38ffc1acd46133/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "source_raw_sha256": "db32b9fe81193d6391370affabe7b05b930968e84a81546362eba301a8e72fdd", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 3, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "source_text_sha256": "38cebd79cd3c20bc59119fc146b96bba9e15cc53aece8ec15fc1f808e01dfffc", "text_chars": 166}
